      "writtenOn": "2021-12-16T21:46:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It looks like we actually have every single field from Instruction in here, but `op` is split up from the rest. Instead of cloning every field, would it make more sense to just include a single skvm::Instruction field in the struct? It feels like it would be simpler (and if we ever, say, added another field, like immD, we would automatically get it here).",
